Package: uk.551.no2theft.smsnumbersprefs
Name: No2Theft SMS Numbers (Separate Settings)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: 551UK
Author: 551UK
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), xyz.cypwn.no2theft16 (>= 1.3.5), preferenceloader
Description: Independent No2Theft SMS recipient editor for iOS 16.
 Displays a separate Settings entry without changing the original
 No2Theft Settings plist, dylib, email logic or PIN logic.
 Writes only firstNumber and secondNumber on explicit edits.
 Respring manually after saving a number.
